 "sentences": [
  "These 82 prints were hidden for decades.",
  "Francisco Goya created this series between 1810 and 1820.",
  "Art historians view them as a visual protest against the violence of the Peninsular War.",
  "While working as a court painter, Goya kept his thoughts on the conflict private.",
  "He was 62 and almost deaf when he started.",
  "They were finally published in 1863, 35 years after his death."
